    clusterBorder: "#7fafcf"
  flowchart:
    curve: basis
    htmlLabels: true
---
flowchart TB
  accTitle: Target 容错与 Session 模型绑定
  accDescr: model=auto 的不可变执行计划为每个模型冻结主 Target 和有序备用 Target。可重试故障先在当前 Target 内重试，再在预算内切换同模型 Target，最后才切换计划中的下一个模型。不可重试错误或 ClientCommit 后失败不会切换。Target 故障不改变 Session 模型绑定，只有能力不足导致的成功模型升级才更新绑定。

  MODEL["已选模型"] --> TARGETS["冻结 Target 顺序<br/>primary → backup 1 → backup 2"]
  TARGETS --> SEND["向当前 Target 发送"]
  SEND --> RESULT{"结果"}
  RESULT -->|"成功并提交"| DONE["返回结果<br/>记录模型 / Target 路径"]
  RESULT -->|"不可重试 4xx"| FAILED["原样返回错误"]
  RESULT -->|"可重试故障且未提交"| RETRY{"当前 Target<br/>仍可重试？"}
  RETRY -->|"是"| RETRY_SEND["占用重试 / 回答预算"] --> SEND
  RETRY -->|"否"| NEXT_TARGET{"还有备用 Target<br/>且切换预算允许？"}
  NEXT_TARGET -->|"是"| SWITCH_TARGET["占用 Target 切换 / 回答预算<br/>保持同一模型"] --> SEND
  NEXT_TARGET -->|"否"| NEXT_MODEL{"计划内还有模型<br/>且切换预算允许？"}
  NEXT_MODEL -->|"是"| SWITCH_MODEL["占用模型切换 / 回答预算<br/>从该模型的 primary 开始"] --> SEND
  NEXT_MODEL -->|"否"| FAILED
  DONE -. "Target 故障不改模型绑定" .-> KEEP["后续 auto Session<br/>继续沿用成功模型"]

  classDef primary fill:#f7fbfd,color:#172229,stroke:#526f7e,stroke-width:1.5px;
  classDef runtime fill:#e7f7f6,color:#172229,stroke:#2d7774,stroke-width:1.5px;
  classDef decision fill:#fff4e7,color:#172229,stroke:#965b15,stroke-width:1.5px;
  classDef fallback fill:#e8f2ff,color:#172229,stroke:#3f75a3,stroke-width:1.5px;
  classDef session fill:#eef0ff,color:#172229,stroke:#625eb5,stroke-width:1.5px;
  classDef result fill:#eaf6ee,color:#172229,stroke:#34794b,stroke-width:2px;
  class MODEL,TARGETS primary;
  class SEND,RETRY_SEND,SWITCH_TARGET,SWITCH_MODEL runtime;
  class RESULT,RETRY,NEXT_TARGET,NEXT_MODEL decision;
  class KEEP session;
  class DONE result;
  class FAILED fallback;
